    "title": "Corinth High Mississippi Writers Class Visits Rowan Oak - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jon R Myers ,\n21 hours ago A new English elective at Corinth High School took its lessons on the road this month. The Corinth High Rowan Oak field trip took 38 students to Oxford to tour William Faulkner’s historic home, the Corinth School District reported. The students are enrolled in Mississippi Writers, a new half-credit... Read full article\n2",
